    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented two-bedroom first-floor apartment in the highly regarded and well-maintained Maelduin development, ideally located just minutes from the main street of Dunshaughlin.\r\n\r\nThis attractive property offers comfortable and practical accommodation, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, investors or those seeking a convenient home within easy reach of local amenities.\r\n\r\nA designated parking space is included with the property, along with a private storage shed, providing valuable additional space for bikes, outdoor equipment and general storage.\r\n\r\nMaelduin is a popular residential development, conveniently positioned close to Dunshaughlin town centre. Residents can enjoy easy access to a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities, all within a short distance.\r\nThe location also offers excellent connectivity to Dublin and surrounding areas, making it an attractive option for commuters."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Minutes walk from Dunshaughlin's Main Street\r\nOutdoor Storage Shed\r\nHallway/ Landing| 2.2m x 5.2m Carpeted stairs, storage area, hotpress, attic space\r\nKitchen/ Dining| 3.6m x 4.0m Tiled floor, modern kitchen units, integrated oven, hob, hood & fridge freezer, double doors to sitting room, balcony\r\nSitting Room| 4.7m x 4.1m Wood flooring, double doors to kitchen, balcony\r\nBedroom 1| 3.3m x 2.7m Wood flooring, built in wardrobes\r\nBedroom 2| 3.3m x 2.6m Wood florring, built in wardrobe\r\nBathroom| 2.2m x 2.1m Tiled floor, Tiled shower unit"
      },
